[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://assets/bonelight/ui/spells/familiar-arcane.png" id="3_icon"]

; A hound of the wizard's own light that runs at his heel and bites what comes close (scripts/Familiar.cs).
;
; BaseDamage is ONE BITE, on the quarry and anything else inside its jaws (Familiar.BaseBiteRadius,
; 18 px, times the player's Area and every milestone's AreaMultiplier). BaseCooldown is the bite rate:
; every cooldown hands each hound one bite, which it spends the moment its quarry is in reach.
; BaseRange is how far from the wizard it hunts, and it leaps 42% of that (Familiar.LeapReachFraction).
; BaseProjectileCount is the hounds; Amount adds more, up to Familiar.MaxHounds.
;
; Written out in full so Player.EnsureRelevantLevelUps generates nothing of its own: every level adds
; 4 to the bite, even levels take the cooldown step every spell gets (it bites faster), odd levels widen
; the hunt by 20 px (and the leap by 8). Level 8: 44 a bite every 0.68 s, hunting 260 px round him.
; A bite is one enemy (and whatever is in its jaws), where the peers' casts land on several, so it bites
; harder than they hit.

